<h1>Privacy Policy for Algotraj</h1>
<p>Last Updated: September 2026</p>

<p>Algotraj is a behavioral‑trajectory, predictive‑logic, and safety‑analysis system created and owned by Austin Enterprise LLC. 
This Privacy Policy explains how information is collected, used, stored, and protected when you use Algotraj or any connected applications, services, or safety‑system integrations.</p>

<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>Algotraj may collect the following categories of information depending on how the system is used:</p>
<ul>
<li>Identity information (name, device identifiers, account identifiers)</li>
<li>Behavioral trajectory and pattern‑analysis data</li>
<li>Location information (if enabled by the user or device)</li>
<li>System interaction logs and usage metadata</li>
<li>Submitted evidence, reports, or media (if applicable)</li>
<li>Technical data such as IP address, browser type, device type, and system metadata</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. How Your Information Is Used</h2>
<p>Algotraj uses collected information to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Generate behavioral trajectories and predictive logic</li>
<li>Improve system accuracy, reliability, and safety</li>
<li>Support emergency‑response or safety‑system integrations</li>
<li>Maintain identity continuity for user profiles</li>
<li>Detect misuse, fraud, or system‑integrity issues</li>
<li>Enhance user experience and system performance</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Data Storage and Security</h2>
<p>All data is stored using industry‑standard encryption, integrity protections, and secure storage practices. 
Austin Enterprise LLC does not sell or share your data with third parties except when required by law or when integrated emergency systems require specific information for safety or legal compliance.</p>

<h2>4. Third‑Party Services</h2>
<p>Algotraj may integrate with external systems such as emergency‑service platforms, analytics tools, or identity‑verification systems. 
These services operate under their own privacy policies and may collect or process data independently.</p>

<h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
<p>You may request access to your data, correction of inaccurate information, or deletion of stored data where legally applicable. 
Requests may be submitted to Austin Enterprise LLC using the contact information below.</p>

<h2>6. Children’s Privacy</h2>
<p>Algotraj does not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. 
If such information is discovered, it will be deleted promptly.</p>

<h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically. 
Updates will be posted on this page with a revised “Last Updated” date.</p>

